WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.910
Revise noun phrases, count and non-count terms, and collective nouns so written

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.088
meanings stay clear.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.302
In “The teacher opened the door”, which word is a common noun? Answer: teacher

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:15.018
Proofread two paragraphs for noun and quantity errors.

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:18.869
Why it works: Teacher names a person generally.
